  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the Presentation Room, when someone is actively using a Pencil and another player takes it away, the drawing mode stays enabled. This will effectively bug the pencil and will keep drawing mode on forever. I suspect this has to do with the animation controller not resetting the animation boolean associated with enabling. Since whenever an animation is triggered, the original value is set. Since the bool is initially on when another player is activating it, it stays on.\n\nI'd like to ask to make the pencil drawing an SDK component with a reset function.",
